	<Item Name="title" Type="String">Transcriptional profile of MRE deficient BLaER1 monocytes [RNA MRE]</Item>
	<Item Name="summary" Type="String">We have identified a MORC3-regulated DNA element (MRE) that regulates the activation of IFNB1 upon loss of MORC3. To study the global transcriptional effects of the MRE, we deleted the MRE in STAT1&#8211;/&#8211; STAT2&#8211;/&#8211; and STAT1&#8211;/&#8211; STAT2&#8211;/&#8211; MORC3&#8211;/&#8211; BLaER1 monocytes and performed RNA-seq.</Item>
